lass=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"discrete\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"peak_factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"uncertainty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rent_growth_annual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.08</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"uncertainty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recommended_option\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npv_5y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"otd_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p95_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"interaction_grid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"params\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"volume_growth_yoy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"peak_factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份规格里 <code>customs_duty_regime</code> 是一个<strong>离散情景</strong>而非连续参数——政策要么变要么不变，对它做「±10%」毫无意义，正确做法是定义两个完整情景并各自跑全套仿真。这是敏感性分析里最常见的类型错误：把离散事件当连续参数扫，得到的曲线没有意义。<code>interaction_grid</code> 显式声明要做双因素网格，因为孤立地看 <code>volume_growth_yoy</code> 与 <code>peak_factor</code> 都会低估它们的联合影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型可信度-回测与误差口径\">模型可信度：回测与误差口径</h2><h3 id=\"用历史回测\">用历史回测</h3><p>一个仿真的输出再精致，如果它的输入分布是错的，结论就是错的。<strong>回测</strong>是唯一低成本的防线：取一个历史时期（需求已知、网络已知、结果已知），用当时的输入分布跑仿真，把输出与实测对比。</p>\n<p>回测要看的是<strong>分布层面的吻合</strong>，不是均值吻合。如果模型预测 p90 时效 4 天而实测是 6 天，但均值都对得上，说明模型低估了尾部——而尾部的低估会直接导致承诺时效过紧。因此回测的指标应当覆盖分位数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{MAPE} = \\frac{100}{n}\\sum\\_{t=1}^{n}\\left|\\frac{A_t - F_t}{A_t}\\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAPE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实测值、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是模型值（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mean_absolute_percentage_error\">Mean absolute percentage error</a>）。MAPE 有两个必须知道的缺陷：实测值接近零时不稳定甚至发散，且低估与高估的惩罚不对称（它会偏向给出偏低的预测）。对跨境时延这类正值且量级稳定的指标，MAPE 可用；对「跨区发货占比」这类可能接近零的指标，应改为绝对误差或分位数损失。预测误差度量的系统性讨论见 Hyndman 与 Koehler（2006, <em>International Journal of Forecasting</em> 22(4), 679–688）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误差口径与决策阈值挂钩\">误差口径与决策阈值挂钩</h3><p>回测的误差必须被转换成决策语言才有用。做法是：把回测误差当作输出指标的置信带宽，再看<strong>选项排序在带宽内是否稳定</strong>。具体地，若方案 A 与方案 B 的 NPV 差距是 200 万，而回测显示模型对 NPV 的误差带是 ±500 万，则这个排序不可信，应当扩大回测样本或降低模型复杂度，而不是急于下结论。</p>\n<p>这条纪律的对偶是：<strong>不要用精度换取虚假的确定感</strong>。一个参数极多的复杂模型可以在回测期拟合得很好，但对未来的外推能力反而更差。网络规划的模型应当偏向结构简单（少参数、机制清晰），因为它的用途是支撑决策而不是做预测比赛。</p>\n<p>误差带一旦确定，它就直接进入下一章的财务比较：开仓与关仓的现金流量级（见 <a href=\"open-close-warehouse-decision\">开仓/关仓与迁移决策</a>）必须与模型误差带放在一起看，若两个方案的 NPV 差距小于误差带，则结论应当表述为「在模型精度内无法区分」，而不是给出一个虚假的排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"情景设计-把不确定变成可辩论的选项\">情景设计：把不确定变成可辩论的选项</h2><h3 id=\"情景不是参数组合\">情景不是参数组合</h3><p>一组「好/中/坏」的参数组合不叫情景，叫参数的三档。真正的情景是<strong>一个自洽的世界状态</strong>——其中的参数不是独立抽出来的，而是由同一个故事驱动。例如「去最低免税额度」这个情景会同时改变：清关成本上升、直邮比例下降、保税仓价值上升、单件平均申报价值下降。这四个变化在参数表里是四项，但在情景里是一件事。</p>\n<p>好的情景设计有三条标准：<strong>互斥且穷尽主要风险</strong>（不重叠，但覆盖决策者真正担心的几种未来）、<strong>内部自洽</strong>（参数之间的方向关系符合机制，例如运价上涨通常伴随运力紧张而不是时效改善）、<strong>可命名</strong>（每个情景有一个业务能记住的名字，否则讨论会退化成参数罗列）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从情景到预案\">从情景到预案</h3><p>情景分析的最后一步是把结论变成预案：对每个「选项排序会翻转」的情景，预先写清楚触发信号与应对动作。这比在情景发生时临时决策有效得多，因为预案可以在冷静时设计、在发生时执行：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情景</th>\n<th>早期信号</th>\n<th>对网络的动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免税额度收紧</td>\n<td>政策草案征求意见</td>\n<td>提前锁定保税产能；评估一般贸易通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求增长远超预期</td>\n<td>连续两月同比 &gt; 40%</td>\n<td>启用三方溢出；加速新仓选址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末端费率跳涨</td>\n<td>承运商调价函</td>\n<td>重跑网络评估；提高集中度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>某节点持续低效</td>\n<td>该节点跨区发货占比连续上升</td>\n<td>触发第四章的 ROI 复盘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的每一行都把「不确定」变成了「可观测信号 + 预定动作」。它是本篇与下一章（开仓/关仓决策）之间的接口——当一个情景被触发时，走的就是第三章第 3 篇的决策流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>敏感性分析要排序的不是「参数敏感度」而是「排序翻转风险」：高敏感 + 高不确定的参数才值得投入。</li>\n<li>单因素扫描会漏掉交互效应，应对龙卷风图上最长的两个参数做双因素网格；网格分区边界若是斜的就存在交互。</li>\n<li>扫描的输出应当是「各方案在不同参数取值下胜出的比例」，而不是指标数值。</li>\n<li>离散事件（政策变/不变）必须作为完整情景处理，不能当作连续参数扫描。</li>\n<li>回测必须比对分布（含分位数）而非只看均值；MAPE 在实测值接近零时不稳定且惩罚不对称，这类指标改用绝对误差或分位数损失。</li>\n<li>回测误差要换算成决策阈值：若选项差距落进模型误差带内，排序不可信，应加强数据或简化模型。</li>\n<li>情景是自洽的世界状态（互斥、穷尽、可命名），分析终局是把「排序会翻转」的情景变成带触发信号与预定动作的预案。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"情景与敏感性分析","id":"情景与敏感性分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：要排序的不是参数敏感度","id":"核心概念-要排序的不是参数敏感度"},{"level":2,"text":"单因素扫描与龙卷风图","id":"单因素扫描与龙卷风图"},{"level":3,"text":"扫描的做法","id":"扫描的做法"},{"level":3,"text":"扫描的两个技术细节","id":"扫描的两个技术细节"},{"level":2,"text":"模型可信度：回测与误差口径","id":"模型可信度-回测与误差口径"},{"level":3,"text":"用历史回测","id":"用历史回测"},{"level":3,"text":"误差口径与决策阈值挂钩","id":"误差口径与决策阈值挂钩"},{"level":2,"text":"情景设计：把不确定变成可辩论的选项","id":"情景设计-把不确定变成可辩论的选项"},{"level":3,"text":"情景不是参数组合","id":"情景不是参数组合"},{"level":3,"text":"从情景到预案","id":"从情景到预案"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"需求/线路网络仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/network-simulation-scenario/demand-lane-simulation"},"next":{"title":"开仓/关仓与迁移决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/network-simulation-scenario/open-close-warehouse-decision"}}